# The plasma rifle, held on a target three units away that stands still: it
# fires faster the longer the button is held (7 a second to 10), each shot
# makes heat, and at full heat it overheats and does not fire until it has cooled
# to a quarter. The target dies on the way and the shots go on; the heat is the
# weapon's whole story.
scenario plasma_rifle_heat
map bloodgulch
start flat_field 77.9 -166.2 0.32 0.0
target 81.0 -166.2 0.32 3.14159265
weapon weapons/plasma rifle/plasma rifle
ticks 360
# aim at the body
input 0 360 pitch=-0.13
input 60 250 fire=1

tolerance position 0
tolerance velocity 0
tolerance facing 0
tolerance state 0
tolerance rounds 0
tolerance heat 0
tolerance shield 0
tolerance body 0
tolerance stun 0
tolerance life 0
tolerance hit 0
tolerance shots 0
tolerance age 0
